  "releaseNotes": "## v2.6.0 (minor)\n\nChanges since v2.5.0:\n\n- Merge remote-tracking branch 'origin/main' into claude/precisenumber-78-hyperbolic-functions ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Refuse a sine whose reduction needs more of pi than exists [patch] ([@Claude](https://github.com/Claude))\n- Measure a baseline ref in the same job as the head [patch] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Assert comparisons with the comparison asserts [patch] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))\n- Implement IHyperbolicFunctions<PreciseNumber> [minor] ([@matt-edmondson](https://github.com/matt-edmondson))",
